chapters=[('start','Start · 0–15 minutes','Fight, heal, Want, craft and borrowed power.'),('hook','Hook · Up to two hours','A second character, yellow risk, Surge, Rift, caravan and first sale.'),('mid','Mid · Base 25–70','Crafter, guild, red zones, outposts and Mob War defence.'),('late','Late · Base 70–99','Black zones, Roads and T6–T8 crafts.'),('seasons','Seasons · Ongoing','Defend cities, play guild seasons and discover why invasions are growing.')]
